.worktrees/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Datasets: raw videos, annotations, frame caches, features never enter the repo (spec 3.3 / 8.2).
# Only the two metadata files below are tracked. data/external/ha-vid-public/ stays ignored.
data/**
!data/README.md
!data/manifest.json
data/external/ha-vid-public/

